      <div class="cta-divider"><span>🍶 想要品鉴正宗酱酒？</span></div>
      
      <div class="cta-products">
        <div class="cta-product">
          <span class="cta-p-icon">🛢️</span>
          <div class="cta-p-info"><strong>君范·雅藏 y5</strong><span>5年坤沙 · 入门首选</span></div>
